%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9be6dd27f2c5a36459a6706a0e005471, type: 3}
  m_Name: FirstNightDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: Hey! You must be the new guy, right? Your boss told me you'd be coming
      tonight.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 1
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: ARJUN
    text: Yeah, that's me. Sorry I'm a little late.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 2
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: Haha, don't worry about it. I've just been waiting here to hand you your
      apartment keys.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 3
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: ARJUN
    text: Oh, thanks. I appreciate it.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 4
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: No problem. Here you go. Apartment 401.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 5
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: ARJUN
    text: Four-oh-one. Got it.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 6
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: Yep, fourth floor. The elevator's right over there. Shouldn't be hard to
      find your way around.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 7
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: ARJUN
    text: Alright. First time living this far from home, so hopefully I don't get
      lost on the first night.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 8
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: Haha, you'll be fine. You'll get used to the place.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 9
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: ARJUN
    text: Hope so. I've been working from home until now, so this whole office thing
      is new to me.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 10
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: Oh, really? Well, welcome to the new routine, then!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 11
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: ARJUN
    text: Yeah, guess so. Anyway, thanks for waiting around for me.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 12
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: Don't mention it.  I was told to make sure you got the keys. I've done
      my part now, so I'm heading out soon.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 13
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: ARJUN
    text: Fair enough. Have a good night!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 14
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: You too! And good luck with all those boxes. Looks like you've got your
      work cut out for you.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 15
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: ARJUN
    text: Haha, yeah. See you around!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: 16
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: See you, man!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 0
    events:
    - eventType: 0
      flagName: gotkeys
      flagValue: 1
      objectiveText: 
    - eventType: 1
      flagName: 
      flagValue: 0
      objectiveText: Deliver Boxes To Your Apartment (401)
    - eventType: 0
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      flagValue: 1
      objectiveText: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
  - dialogueType: 0
    speakerName: RECEPTIONIST
    text: See you, man!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    condition:
      flagName: TalkedToReceptionist
      requiredValue: 1
    events: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
